# ── Optional Local Development Only (Ollama Fallback) ─────────
# Gemini is primary. Ollama acts as local development fallback if Gemini fails/times out.
# Set AI_PROVIDER=gemini-only if you want to disable local Ollama fallback.
# OLLAMA_HOST=http://localhost:11434
# OLLAMA_CHAT_MODEL=qwen3
